// Bloodroute route: PvE Warrior. Sword, then Kriig's Reaper; Weapon Skill Power, Warrior blood and Blood spells
// that keep Leech on the target for Sanguine Mastery. Boss locations, shared steps and views: routes/shared.js.
// Registers itself with BR.registerRoute; shared.js and needs.js (generated by site/build-needs.js) must load first.
